      "text": "🔥🚨 1 DAY TO GO! 🚨🔥\n\nThe wait is almost over — TOMORROW the world of JACKSON WANG: 𝐌𝐀𝐆𝐈𝐂𝐌𝐀𝐍𝟐 𝐖𝐎𝐑𝐋𝐃 𝐓𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟓–𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟔 comes ALIVE! 💥\nGet ready for a night of explosive energy, jaw-dropping performances, and pure MAGIC that will leave you breathless! ✨\n\nOutfits ready? Voices loud? Hearts on fire? ❤️‍🔥\n Because the MAGIC begins NOW! 🔥\n\n📍 Venue: Araneta Coliseum\n 📅 Date: November 2, 2025 (Sunday)\n ⏰ Time: 7:00 PM\n 🎟 Tickets are available at https://t.co/RPnx5IP1WX and https://t.co/CAcZ7ZbnuF\n\nLocal Ticket Buyers\n Ticketnet Online: https://t.co/RTyvc4AOjN\n Ticketnet Outlets: https://t.co/tsvBmVfVzR\nInternational Buyers\n Fantopia Link: https://t.co/o7ZbHWKUbN\n\nℹ️ For ticketing inquiries or concerns, please contact:\n Ticketnet\n 📞 (8) 911-55-55\n 📧 info@ticketnet.com.ph\nFantopia\n 📧 support@fantopia.io\n\n#MAGICMAN2WORLDTOUR #JACKSONWANGWORLDTOUR #잭슨 #王嘉尔 #JacksonWang #TEAMWANGRecords #iMeAsia #iMePhilippines #iMePHLive",
